# Kasmina's Transmutation: "Enchanted creature loses all abilities and has base power and toughness 1/1." Bot2's Samut,
# Hazoret's Champion ("Creatures you control have haste") loses its static ability, so it gives nothing to anything (CR
# 613.1f, 611.3a): on turn 2 Bot2's Llanowar Elves, cast that turn, attacks with haste beside Samut (the positive control,
# 3 damage), but the Elves Bot2 casts on turn 4, after the Aura, are summoning sick and can't attack (CR 302.6). Samut keeps
# its types and color - the Aura changes nothing else (unlike Eaten by Piranhas) - and is a 1/1: it attacks for 1.

